                  <h3>HTML Example: One Navigation Landmark</h3>
                  <p>When only one navigation landmark on a page, a label is optional.</p>

                  <div class="code">
                    <code>
                    <strong>&lt;nav&gt;</strong>
                    <br>
                    <br>
                    &nbsp;&nbsp;&lt;h2&gt;<em>title for navigation area</em>&lt;h2&gt;<br>
                    <br>
                    &nbsp;&nbsp;&lt;ul&gt;<br>
                    &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="page1.html"&gt;<em>Link 1</em>&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;<br>
                    &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="page2.html"&gt;<em>Link 2</em>&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;<br>
                    &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="page3.html"&gt;<em>Link 3</em>&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;<br>
                    &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="page4.html"&gt;<em>Link 4</em>&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;<br>
                    &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;.....<br>
                    &nbsp;&nbsp;&lt;/ul&gt;<br>
                    <strong>&lt;/nav&gt;</strong>
                    </code>
                  </div>

                  <h3>HTML Example: More Than One Navigation Landmark Example</h3>
                  <p>When there is more than one navigation landmark on a page, each should have a unique label.</p>
                  <div class="code">
                    <code>
                    <strong>&lt;nav aria-labelledby="nav1"&gt;</strong>
                    <br>
                    <br>
                    &nbsp;&nbsp;&lt;h2 <strong>id="nav1"</strong>&gt;<em>title for navigation 1</em>&lt;h2&gt;<br>
                    <br>
                    &nbsp;&nbsp;&lt;ul&gt;<br>
                    &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="page11.html"&gt;<em>Link 1</em>&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;<br>
                    &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="page12.html"&gt;<em>Link 2</em>&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;<br>
                    &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="page13.html"&gt;<em>Link 3</em>&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;<br>
                    &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="page14.html"&gt;<em>Link 4</em>&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;<br>
                    &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;.....<br>
                    &nbsp;&nbsp;&lt;/ul&gt;<br>
                    <strong>&lt;/nav&gt;</strong>
                    <br>
                    <br>
                    ....<br>
                    <br>
                    <strong>&lt;nav  aria-labelledby="nav2"&gt;</strong>
                    <br>
                    <br>
                    &nbsp;&nbsp;&lt;h2 <strong>id="nav2"</strong>&gt;<em>title for navigation 2</em>&lt;h2&gt;<br>
                    <br>
                    &nbsp;&nbsp;&lt;ul&gt;<br>
                    &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="page21.html"&gt;<em>Link 4</em>&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;<br>
                    &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="page22.html"&gt;<em>Link 6</em>&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;<br>
                    &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="page23.html"&gt;<em>Link 7</em>&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;<br>
                    &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="page24.html"&gt;<em>Link 8</em>&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;<br>
                    &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;.....<br>
                    &nbsp;&nbsp;&lt;/ul&gt;<br>
                    <strong>&lt;/nav&gt;</strong>
                    </code>
                  </div>
